 1px solid rgb(206, 212, 217); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; border-top-color: #ced4d9; border-right-color: #ced4d9; border-left-color: #ced4d9;\\\">$value -case(property'svcesc:PRO Number')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 44.8906px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 38%; background-color: #fafafa; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(206, 212, 217); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222222; border-top-color: #ced4d9; border-right-color: #ced4d9; border-left-color: #ced4d9;\\\"><strong>New Pickup ETA</strong></td>\\n<td style=\\\"padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(206, 212, 217); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; border-top-color: #ced4d9; border-right-color: #ced4d9; border-left-color: #ced4d9;\\\">$value -case(property'svcesc:New Pick Up ETA')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 44.8906px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 38%; background-color: #fafafa; padding: 10px 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222222; border-color: #ced4d9;\\\"><strong>New Delivery ETA</strong></td>\\n<td style=\\\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; border-color: #ced4d9;\\\">\\n<div>$value -case(property'svcesc:New Delivery ETA')$</div>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^(Mechanical Failure - MF|Traffic/Road Closures/Accident - BE|Driver Issues - AH|Weather Conditions - AO|Customs/Border Delays - BD|Regulatory Compliance Checks - RCC)$'$-->\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 44.7969px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 38%; background-color: #fafafa; padding: 10px 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222222; border-color: #ced4d9;\\\"><strong>Reason for Delay</strong></td>\\n<td style=\\\"padding: 10px 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; border-color: #ced4d9;\\\"><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Mechanical Failure - MF$'$--> Your transportation is delayed due to an unexpected mechanical issue with the vehicle. We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience. <!--$endif$--><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Traffic/Road Closures/Accident - BE$'$--> Your shipment is running behind schedule due to traffic congestion, a road closure, or an incident affecting traffic flow. We apologize for the delay and appreciate your patience. <!--$endif$--><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Driver Issues - AH$'$--> Your transportation is delayed due to an unforeseen driver-related issue. We apologize for the inconvenience and are working to get you on your way as soon as possible. <!--$endif$--><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Weather Conditions - AO$'$--> Your transportation is delayed due to adverse weather conditions affecting travel. We apologize for the delay and appreciate your patience as we prioritize the safety of our passengers and drivers. <!--$endif$--><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Customs/Border Delays - BD$'$--> Your transportation is delayed due to customs or border processing. We appreciate your patience and understanding as we work through the required procedures. <!--$endif$--><!--$if -fieldregex'Delay Codes'='^Regulatory Compliance Checks - RCC$'$--> Your transportation is delayed while we address a regulatory compliance item. Thank you for your patience and understanding. <!--$endif$--></td>\\n</tr>\\n<!--$endif$--></tbody>\\n</table>\\n<em>Note: All pickup and delivery ETAs reflect local time.<br><br></em><em></em></div>\\n<div><b><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\">Please reply to this email to confirm whether you ACCEPT or NEED TO UPDATE the ETAs for this shipment.</span></b></div>\\n<div></div>\\n<div><strong>Note: To request a more convenient time for shipment Pickup / Delivery, all </strong><strong>times must be in your local timezone and later than the currently provided Pickup / Delivery times.</strong><br><br>Best regards,</div>\\n<div>FedEx Custom Critical</div>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 76.059px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"background-color: #f8f8f8; border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2; text-align: center; padding: 16px 20px 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #555555;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; text-transform: uppercase;\\\"><span>FEDEX FREIGHT NOTIFICATION</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\\\">Powered by <span style=\\\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: bold;\\\">iService&reg;</span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</center>\""
